  user_input {
    user_response: "Tu es un d\303\251veloppeur expert en web app PWA ultra-l\303\251g\303\250res (HTML / Tailwind CSS / JavaScript pur).\n\nVoici le code actuel de mon fichier index.html pour mon projet \"JoursOff\", une application de suivi de cong\303\251s/RTT et d\'optimisation des ponts pour les salari\303\251s fran\303\247ais :\n\n--- CODE ACTUEL ---\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>JoursOff \342\200\224 Mon suivi de cong\303\251s & RTT</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 p-4 max-w-md mx-auto min-h-screen relative pb-10\">\n\n  <!-- En-t\303\252te -->\n  <header class=\"my-6 flex justify-between items-center\">\n    <div>\n      <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-indigo-600 tracking-tight\">JoursOff</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">Mes cong\303\251s & RTT sous contr\303\264le</p>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-100\">\n      2026\n    </span>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Cartes de Solde -->\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100\">\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold\">Cong\303\251s Pay\303\251s</span>\n      <p id=\"cp-count\" class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 mt-1\">25,0</p>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-emerald-600 font-semibold\">jours restants</span>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100\">\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold\">RTT</span>\n      <p id=\"rtt-count\" class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-indigo-600 mt-1\">10,0</p>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-indigo-500 font-semibold\">jours restants</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Bouton d\'action -->\n  <button onclick=\"toggleModal(true)\" class=\"w-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold py-3.5 rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-700 active:scale-[0.98] transition mb-6\">\n    + Poser un jour off\n  </button>\n\n  <!-- Liste des absences -->\n  <section>\n    <h2 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold mb-3\">Mes jours pos\303\251s</h2>\n    <div id=\"leave-list\" class=\"space-y-2\">\n      <!-- Les \303\251l\303\251ments s\'ajouteront ici dynamiquement -->\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Modal / Formulaire de saisie -->\n  <div id=\"modal\" class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-sm hidden flex items-end sm:items-center justify-center p-4 z-50\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white w-full max-w-sm rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-4\">\n      <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-slate-800 text-lg\">Nouveau jour off</h3>\n        <button onclick=\"toggleModal(false)\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-xl font-bold\">&times;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <form id=\"leave-form\" onsubmit=\"saveLeave(event)\" class=\"space-y-3\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-1\">TYPE DE CONG\303\211</label>\n          <select id=\"leave-type\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-sm font-medium focus:outline-indigo-600\">\n            <option value=\"CP\">Cong\303\251 Pay\303\251 (CP)</option>\n            <option value=\"RTT\">RTT</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-1\">DATE</label>\n          <input type=\"date\" id=\"leave-date\" required class=\"w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-sm font-medium focus:outline-indigo-600\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-1\">DUR\303\211E (JOURS)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"leave-days\" step=\"0.5\" min=\"0.5\" value=\"1\" required class=\"w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-sm font-medium focus:outline-indigo-600\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-2 flex gap-2\">\n          <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"toggleModal(false)\" class=\"w-1/2 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 font-bold py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-200 transition\">\n            Annuler\n          </button>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-1/2 bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-indigo-700 transition\">\n            Valider\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    let leaves = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\'joursoff_data\')) || [];\n\n    function toggleModal(show) {\n      document.getElementById(\'modal\').classList.toggle(\'hidden\', !show);\n    }\n\n    function saveLeave(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const type = document.getElementById(\'leave-type\').value;\n      const date = document.getElementById(\'leave-date\').value;\n      const days = parseFloat(document.getElementById(\'leave-days\').value);\n\n      leaves.push({ id: Date.now(), type, date, days });\n      localStorage.setItem(\'joursoff_data\', JSON.stringify(leaves));\n      \n      toggleModal(false);\n      document.getElementById(\'leave-form\').reset();\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function deleteLeave(id) {\n      leaves = leaves.filter(item => item.id !== id);\n      localStorage.setItem(\'joursoff_data\', JSON.stringify(leaves));\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function render() {\n      const list = document.getElementById(\'leave-list\');\n      list.innerHTML = \'\';\n\n      let cpTotal = 25;\n      let rttTotal = 10;\n\n      if (leaves.length === 0) {\n        list.innerHTML = `<p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 italic text-center py-4\">Aucun jour pos\303\251 pour l\'instant.</p>`;\n      } else {\n        leaves.forEach(item => {\n          if (item.type === \'CP\') cpTotal -= item.days;\n          if (item.type === \'RTT\') rttTotal -= item.days;\n\n          const dateFormatted = new Date(item.date).toLocaleDateString(\'fr-FR\', { day: \'numeric\', month: \'short\' });\n\n          list.innerHTML += `\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm flex justify-between items-center\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"inline-block px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md ${item.type === \'CP\' ? \'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700\' : \'bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700\'}\">${item.type}</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 ml-2\">${dateFormatted}</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500\">-${item.days} j</span>\n                <button onclick=\"deleteLeave(${item.id})\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-red-500 font-bold text-sm\">&times;</button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          `;\n        });\n      }\n\n      document.getElementById(\'cp-count\').innerText = cpTotal.toFixed(1).replace(\'.\', \',\');\n      document.getElementById(\'rtt-count\').innerText = rttTotal.toFixed(1).replace(\'.\', \',\');\n    }\n\n    render();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n--- FIN DU CODE ---\n\nTA MISSION :\nMets \303\240 jour ce fichier unique `index.html` en ajoutant un module \"Optimiseur de Ponts 2026\" :\n1. Analyse la liste des jours f\303\251ri\303\251s fran\303\247ais de l\'ann\303\251e 2026 (Jour de l\'An, Lundi de P\303\242ques, F\303\252te du Travail, Victoire 1945, Ascension, Lundi de Pentec\303\264te, F\303\252te Nationale, Assomption, Toussaint, Armistice, No\303\253l).\n2. Rep\303\250re automatiquement les opportunit\303\251s de ponts (ex: un jour f\303\251ri\303\251 un mardi ou un jeudi).\n3. Affiche une section visuelle sous forme de cartes d\'opportunit\303\251s (\"Bons plans de ponts\") avec un bouton \"+ Poser en 1 clic\" qui ajoute automatiquement le jour off dans la liste globale et met \303\240 jour le solde.\n4. Rends un code HTML complet et directement ex\303\251cutable, pr\303\252t \303\240 \303\252tre copi\303\251-coll\303\251 sans rien couper. en incluant \303\251galement les d\303\251pendances Tailwind CSS et Lucide Icons n\303\251cessaires."
    items {
      text: "Tu es un d\303\251veloppeur expert en web app PWA ultra-l\303\251g\303\250res (HTML / Tailwind CSS / JavaScript pur).\n\nVoici le code actuel de mon fichier index.html pour mon projet \"JoursOff\", une application de suivi de cong\303\251s/RTT et d\'optimisation des ponts pour les salari\303\251s fran\303\247ais :\n\n--- CODE ACTUEL ---\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>JoursOff \342\200\224 Mon suivi de cong\303\251s & RTT</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 p-4 max-w-md mx-auto min-h-screen relative pb-10\">\n\n  <!-- En-t\303\252te -->\n  <header class=\"my-6 flex justify-between items-center\">\n    <div>\n      <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-indigo-600 tracking-tight\">JoursOff</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\">Mes cong\303\251s & RTT sous contr\303\264le</p>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-100\">\n      2026\n    </span>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Cartes de Solde -->\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100\">\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold\">Cong\303\251s Pay\303\251s</span>\n      <p id=\"cp-count\" class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 mt-1\">25,0</p>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-emerald-600 font-semibold\">jours restants</span>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100\">\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold\">RTT</span>\n      <p id=\"rtt-count\" class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold text-indigo-600 mt-1\">10,0</p>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-indigo-500 font-semibold\">jours restants</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Bouton d\'action -->\n  <button onclick=\"toggleModal(true)\" class=\"w-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold py-3.5 rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-700 active:scale-[0.98] transition mb-6\">\n    + Poser un jour off\n  </button>\n\n  <!-- Liste des absences -->\n  <section>\n    <h2 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold mb-3\">Mes jours pos\303\251s</h2>\n    <div id=\"leave-list\" class=\"space-y-2\">\n      <!-- Les \303\251l\303\251ments s\'ajouteront ici dynamiquement -->\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Modal / Formulaire de saisie -->\n  <div id=\"modal\" class=\"fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-sm hidden flex items-end sm:items-center justify-center p-4 z-50\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white w-full max-w-sm rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-4\">\n      <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-slate-800 text-lg\">Nouveau jour off</h3>\n        <button onclick=\"toggleModal(false)\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-xl font-bold\">&times;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <form id=\"leave-form\" onsubmit=\"saveLeave(event)\" class=\"space-y-3\">\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-1\">TYPE DE CONG\303\211</label>\n          <select id=\"leave-type\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-sm font-medium focus:outline-indigo-600\">\n            <option value=\"CP\">Cong\303\251 Pay\303\251 (CP)</option>\n            <option value=\"RTT\">RTT</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-1\">DATE</label>\n          <input type=\"date\" id=\"leave-date\" required class=\"w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-sm font-medium focus:outline-indigo-600\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 mb-1\">DUR\303\211E (JOURS)</label>\n          <input type=\"number\" id=\"leave-days\" step=\"0.5\" min=\"0.5\" value=\"1\" required class=\"w-full bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-3 text-sm font-medium focus:outline-indigo-600\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-2 flex gap-2\">\n          <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"toggleModal(false)\" class=\"w-1/2 bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 font-bold py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-200 transition\">\n            Annuler\n          </button>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-1/2 bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-indigo-700 transition\">\n            Valider\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    let leaves = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\'joursoff_data\')) || [];\n\n    function toggleModal(show) {\n      document.getElementById(\'modal\').classList.toggle(\'hidden\', !show);\n    }\n\n    function saveLeave(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const type = document.getElementById(\'leave-type\').value;\n      const date = document.getElementById(\'leave-date\').value;\n      const days = parseFloat(document.getElementById(\'leave-days\').value);\n\n      leaves.push({ id: Date.now(), type, date, days });\n      localStorage.setItem(\'joursoff_data\', JSON.stringify(leaves));\n      \n      toggleModal(false);\n      document.getElementById(\'leave-form\').reset();\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function deleteLeave(id) {\n      leaves = leaves.filter(item => item.id !== id);\n      localStorage.setItem(\'joursoff_data\', JSON.stringify(leaves));\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function render() {\n      const list = document.getElementById(\'leave-list\');\n      list.innerHTML = \'\';\n\n      let cpTotal = 25;\n      let rttTotal = 10;\n\n      if (leaves.length === 0) {\n        list.innerHTML = `<p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 italic text-center py-4\">Aucun jour pos\303\251 pour l\'instant.</p>`;\n      } else {\n        leaves.forEach(item => {\n          if (item.type === \'CP\') cpTotal -= item.days;\n          if (item.type === \'RTT\') rttTotal -= item.days;\n\n          const dateFormatted = new Date(item.date).toLocaleDateString(\'fr-FR\', { day: \'numeric\', month: \'short\' });\n\n          list.innerHTML += `\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm flex justify-between items-center\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"inline-block px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-md ${item.type === \'CP\' ? \'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700\' : \'bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700\'}\">${item.type}</span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 ml-2\">${dateFormatted}</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500\">-${item.days} j</span>\n                <button onclick=\"deleteLeave(${item.id})\" class=\"text-slate-300 hover:text-red-500 font-bold text-sm\">&times;</button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          `;\n        });\n      }\n\n      document.getElementById(\'cp-count\').innerText = cpTotal.toFixed(1).replace(\'.\', \',\');\n      document.getElementById(\'rtt-count\').innerText = rttTotal.toFixed(1).replace(\'.\', \',\');\n    }\n\n    render();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n--- FIN DU CODE ---\n\nTA MISSION :\nMets \303\240 jour ce fichier unique `index.html` en ajoutant un module \"Optimiseur de Ponts 2026\" :\n1. Analyse la liste des jours f\303\251ri\303\251s fran\303\247ais de l\'ann\303\251e 2026 (Jour de l\'An, Lundi de P\303\242ques, F\303\252te du Travail, Victoire 1945, Ascension, Lundi de Pentec\303\264te, F\303\252te Nationale, Assomption, Toussaint, Armistice, No\303\253l).\n2. Rep\303\250re automatiquement les opportunit\303\251s de ponts (ex: un jour f\303\251ri\303\251 un mardi ou un jeudi).\n3. Affiche une section visuelle sous forme de cartes d\'opportunit\303\251s (\"Bons plans de ponts\") avec un bouton \"+ Poser en 1 clic\" qui ajoute automatiquement le jour off dans la liste globale et met \303\240 jour le solde.\n4. Rends un code HTML complet et directement ex\303\251cutable, pr\303\252t \303\240 \303\252tre copi\303\251-coll\303\251 sans rien couper. en incluant \303\251galement les d\303\251pendances Tailwind CSS et Lucide Icons n\303\251cessaires."
    }
  }
}
