  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing User Intent**\n\nI am now carefully analyzing the user\'s request, specifically focusing on the interplay between their React Vite app and standalone HTML code. I\'m breaking down their exact wording, aiming to understand the specific nuances of their needs. My aim is to extract the core functionality required. I\'m focusing on the relationship between these different components.\n\n\n**Defining Project Scope**\n\nI\'ve shifted my focus to the project\'s scope, specifically integrating a \"Bridge Optimizer 2026\" module into the existing `index.html` file. I\'m taking the requirement of a standalone HTML code seriously. Now I am dissecting the specific tasks: analyzing French holidays, identifying potential bridge opportunities, and designing a visual section with one-click functionalities. I am also planning how to include Tailwind CSS and Lucide Icons.\n\n\n**Clarifying Output Requirements**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the output, aiming for both a live, interactive React Vite app and a fully functional, copy-pasteable standalone `index.html` file. My goal is to ensure the app includes a button for easy extraction of the HTML code. The live app must present the full user experience, from public holiday analysis to bridge optimization, with PWA compliance and mobile responsiveness. The standalone code will also be included in the response. I\'m reviewing PWA integration details now.\n\n\n"
